{"id":"raio","lemma":"raio","pos":"noun","rank":310,"glosses":["ray","beam, ray (of light or radiation)","lightning"],"ipa":"/ˈʁaj.u/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"raios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-raio.wav","formAudio":{"raios":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-raios.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu vi um raio.","en":"I saw a lightning bolt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187711","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Raios podem ser perigosos.","en":"Lightning can be dangerous.","words":[null,{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"risky","l":"perigoso"}]},{"text":"Fui atingido por um raio.","en":"I got hit by lightning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534048","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to strike, to touch","l":"atingir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Depois do raio, veio o trovão.","en":"After the lightning, came the thunder.","words":[{"g":"later"},{"g":"of the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"thunder"}]},{"text":"Um raio atingiu a torre.","en":"Lightning struck the tower.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to strike, to touch","l":"atingir"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"tower"}]}]}